{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>By what shall I know</b> במה — by the א״ת ב״ש alphabet — שי״ץ — which sums to ת׳. Therefore the decree of ת׳ was decreed upon his descendants. The reckoning of במה אדע: two [letters] which are נ״ב — no man passed in Judah, and seventy were in exile."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:09.386675463Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}